[12;38H  \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252mrailmux ssh — agent-pane wheel served locally, not forwarded\u001b[13;38H  upstream:\u001b[14;38H  1. handle_terminal_part gets the SgrMouseEvent and dispatches to\u001b[15;38H  LocalHistoryView.wheel.\u001b[16;38H  2. wheel() resolves the pane via _route_at; a hit on an agent\u001b[17;38H  viewport scrolls _HistoryViewport.offset and returns HistoryAction\u001b[18;38H  with render_history=True and forwarded_input=b\"\" — no upstream\u001b[19;38H  input.\u001b[20;38H  3. apply_history_action only sends upstream when\u001b[21;38H  action.forwarded_input is set; empty means nothing reaches tmux. The\u001b[22;38H  overlay is painted client-side via surface.paint_overlays.\u001b[23;38H  4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not\u001b[24;38H  tmux copy-mode; the implementation notes stock tmux WheelUpPane\u001b[25;38H  would enter copy-mode, which is deliberately avoided.\u001b[26;38H  Focused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_rou\u001b[27;38H  tes_sidebar_immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts\u001b[28;38H  agent_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\u001b[29;38H  Suggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True,\u001b[30;38H  proving the overlay rendered rather than merely dropping the event.\u001b[34;38H\u001b[38;5;239m──────────────────"]
